# Commit messages

Commit messages describe the change only.

- Do not add Cursor, the agent, or any AI tool as an author, co-author, trailer, or footer.
- Do not add `Co-authored-by` lines for Cursor or `cursoragent@cursor.com`.
- If a commit is created with that credit, remove it before pushing.

